{
  "_comment": "Sensor identification rules. 'verifiedOn' lists model identifiers where the mapping was validated by differential load testing (sensa-probe: idle vs. all-core CPU load vs. Metal GPU load). The SSD (NAND) sensor was validated against the drive's own SMART temperature (36.0 vs 35.85 °C). Rules apply only to the chip generations listed; anything unmatched is shown with its raw key as Unknown.",
  "rules": [
